 "remarks": "Newly constructed 2 bedroom, 1 bath townhouse-style unit (Unit E) with approx. 1,313 sq ft. Experience the perfect blend of modern living and serene surroundings in this energy-efficient home, located on a private lot along Route 7 in Wilton. Enjoy the tranquility of a beautiful brook and expansive grassy field, all while being conveniently close to local amenities. Highlights: custom kitchen with granite countertops and new stainless steel appliances; luxury bathroom with granite walls; energy-efficient heating and central air; hardwood flooring; dishwasher and in-unit washer/dryer; deck and yard space; ample off-street parking; fenced-in child play area; shared picnic tables for outdoor dining; blue stone pathway to your door; serene brook views. Dog and cat friendly. Water, grounds maintenance, mowing and snow removal included. Tenant pays electric and internet.",
